WEBVTT

00:14.410 --> 00:16.030
I'm going to go check on the Knockers!

00:17.580 --> 00:18.480
<i>Please...</i>

00:20.100 --> 00:21.540
<i>Please be all right!</i>

00:26.160 --> 00:27.680
Mister Alantsil!

00:27.680 --> 00:29.550
I'm sure they'll be fine without me.

00:29.970 --> 00:32.720
Please, let me look out for the 
son that I've finally met again.

00:33.830 --> 00:35.050
Thank you!

00:44.210 --> 00:45.900
He wouldn't have...

00:46.630 --> 00:49.440
How are we supposed to 
subdue something like that?

00:49.440 --> 00:51.150
We're not going to subdue it.

00:51.720 --> 00:53.650
We're going to knock it to the ground.

00:54.840 --> 00:55.650
Let's go!

00:58.820 --> 00:59.990
Zebi, if you would!

01:00.850 --> 01:01.740
Will do!

01:08.300 --> 01:09.180
Pardon me!

01:09.590 --> 01:10.710
Sting!

01:12.370 --> 01:13.580
I've failed.

01:14.590 --> 01:16.090
Sky Rend!

01:31.320 --> 01:32.360
Guard!

01:34.220 --> 01:36.610
Hot! That's hot!

01:38.070 --> 01:39.120
Magic Flame,

01:39.750 --> 01:41.200
Take Control.

01:47.940 --> 01:50.130
Shall we compare our strength,

01:50.990 --> 01:53.380
Magical Flame Beast, Salamandra?

02:10.770 --> 02:15.070
<b>Chillin'</b>

02:10.770 --> 02:15.070
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

03:26.010 --> 03:29.020
<b>Episode 11</b>

03:26.010 --> 03:29.020
<b>Dariel Has a Showdown.</b>

03:33.090 --> 03:34.230
Everyone!

03:34.230 --> 03:35.270
Are you all right?

03:35.880 --> 03:37.600
That's Master Dariel's voice!

03:37.600 --> 03:39.170
Master Dariel!

03:39.170 --> 03:40.240
Thank goodness!

03:40.880 --> 03:43.350
Son, leave this to me.

03:51.630 --> 03:54.860
We have to do something about 
that first, don't we?

03:54.860 --> 03:55.680
Yes.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.420
Everyone, wait just a 
little longer, all right?

03:57.420 --> 03:58.420
All right!

04:03.620 --> 04:04.710
Fearsome Emperor's...

04:05.520 --> 04:06.520
Sky Rend!

04:11.150 --> 04:12.400
Wow.

04:24.530 --> 04:26.530
Mayor! It's too dangerous!

05:07.480 --> 05:09.580
Dariel!

05:10.800 --> 05:11.970
Did it run away?

05:12.520 --> 05:13.830
We've won.

05:15.600 --> 05:17.550
But... that monster...

05:18.710 --> 05:22.450
I think I felt something 
like hatred coming from it.

05:23.710 --> 05:24.790
<i>Hatred?</i>

05:25.870 --> 05:27.340
<i>No, to me...</i>

05:27.340 --> 05:29.630
<i>I got a nostalgic feeling from it.</i>

05:29.630 --> 05:30.600
Dariel...

05:32.350 --> 05:35.600
I will return the the Demon King's castle.

05:37.600 --> 05:41.250
Carry me there, please. I used 
up my magical energy earlier.

05:41.250 --> 05:42.360
Really?

05:46.510 --> 05:48.920
I wonder what brought that on so suddenly?

05:48.920 --> 05:50.580
Let's go rescue the Knockers.

05:51.110 --> 05:52.120
Yes, sir!

05:55.950 --> 05:58.120
Master Dariel!

05:58.750 --> 06:00.670
I'm so glad you're all safe.

06:00.670 --> 06:03.130
Master Dariel, you're our savior!

06:03.430 --> 06:05.040
Yeah! Yeah!

06:11.100 --> 06:13.040
<i>I'm nothing so impressive.</i>

06:14.030 --> 06:16.820
<i>I wasn't able to protect everything.</i>

06:18.220 --> 06:19.320
Son...

06:20.850 --> 06:23.650
Don't think that you have to be 
able to handle everything yourself.

06:24.100 --> 06:26.080
Those who stand at the top...

06:26.080 --> 06:28.650
must be sure borrow the strength 
of others when necessary.

06:29.610 --> 06:30.810
Big Bro!

06:30.810 --> 06:32.910
We brought relief supplies!

06:35.100 --> 06:35.750
I will.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.420
There's a problem!

06:39.800 --> 06:41.670
One of the Guild workers is missing!

06:42.180 --> 06:45.040
We took shelter in the mine together, but...

06:45.040 --> 06:47.380
We'll go with you to search!

06:48.130 --> 06:49.380
Leave things here to me.

06:51.590 --> 06:53.390
Thank you.

07:06.080 --> 07:07.940
Well, if it isn't Father!

07:07.940 --> 07:09.610
What brings you here so suddenly?

07:09.920 --> 07:10.800
What's this?

07:10.800 --> 07:13.110
I see you have my compatriot 
Zebiantes with you.

07:17.210 --> 07:19.870
Did you enter the Room of Secrets?

07:20.480 --> 07:22.620
Dear me. What could that be?

07:25.840 --> 07:27.000
That was a lie.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.420
I was just kidding.

07:28.970 --> 07:32.260
I remember everything 
you've taught me, Father.

07:33.640 --> 07:37.260
So... what is this Room of Secrets?

07:37.920 --> 07:40.690
A chamber hidden inside 
the Demon King's castle.

07:43.070 --> 07:47.370
Since ancient times, every hex ever 
developed has been stored within.

07:49.050 --> 07:54.530
Hexes, you see, are far more powerful 
than any other magic known to the world.

07:55.680 --> 07:57.920
And they are accordingly more risky.

07:57.920 --> 08:01.120
Because our ancestors feared them,
 they sealed the hexes away.

08:04.950 --> 08:08.880
Among those hexes is a technique for making 
a magical beast serve you.

08:09.990 --> 08:14.670
I sensed a trace of your will from 
the Salamandra I saw at the mine.

08:17.400 --> 08:19.340
It was your doing, wasn't it?

08:22.800 --> 08:25.650
Why didn't I notice sooner?

08:26.950 --> 08:28.900
You've always been so diligent.

08:28.900 --> 08:32.460
The year you spent traveling, you were 
searching for magical beasts, weren't you?

08:32.460 --> 08:34.910
Father, are we done here?

08:35.270 --> 08:38.170
I have an important errand to...

08:36.920 --> 08:39.660
Why are you like this?

08:40.190 --> 08:43.300
Unlike Dariel, you were born 
with such a talent for magic!

08:43.300 --> 08:46.420
Why do you always let that power go to waste?

08:47.680 --> 08:48.700
<i>A waste?</i>

08:49.550 --> 08:50.550
Am I...

08:51.170 --> 08:52.360
a waste?

08:55.770 --> 08:56.740
Stop talking...

08:56.940 --> 08:58.180
Stop talking...

08:58.180 --> 09:00.140
Just stop talking!

09:00.140 --> 09:01.410
What about you, Father?

09:01.410 --> 09:04.110
You were with the Hero and those 
other humans, weren't you?

09:04.110 --> 09:05.600
Did you think I didn't know?

09:07.320 --> 09:11.110
I saw you through the eyes of the 
Magical Flame Beast, Salamandra.

09:11.970 --> 09:14.640
Are you playing at being 
friends with the humans?

09:15.490 --> 09:18.500
The hex of Spirit Synchronization Magic.

09:18.500 --> 09:19.990
So you did use it.

09:20.710 --> 09:24.370
That weakens the caster's body 
and eats away at the mind.

09:24.370 --> 09:27.120
Soon, it will cause the boundaries between
 yourself and others to become indistinct.

09:27.610 --> 09:29.720
My foolish, stupid son.

09:31.090 --> 09:33.910
To think you'd turn your hand to hexes 
while serving as one of the Four Generals,

09:33.910 --> 09:36.380
and expose our people to such danger!

09:36.760 --> 09:40.140
You are unworthy of being 
one of the Four Generals!

09:43.530 --> 09:46.350
Come, Magical Flame Beast, Salamandra!

09:49.890 --> 09:55.440
Thankfully, the current Hero and the 
previous Hero are in the same place.

09:56.210 --> 09:58.360
If I defeat them both at once, 
it will be a huge achievement.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.570
Wait!

10:01.570 --> 10:02.800
Bashbarza!

10:02.800 --> 10:04.650
Be well, Father!

10:06.430 --> 10:08.200
You should stop!

10:08.200 --> 10:12.430
The Grandpa Hero is stupid scary, you know?

10:14.270 --> 10:17.130
Don't commit more sins 
than you already have.

10:19.900 --> 10:23.150
Follow close so you 
don't get separated from us!

10:23.150 --> 10:25.640
Thank you. This is a great help.

10:30.490 --> 10:31.900
What is this?

10:33.140 --> 10:34.270
For now, let's get out of here!

10:34.270 --> 10:35.490
Sure thing!

10:35.490 --> 10:36.980
Wait.

10:45.850 --> 10:48.320
Small ones,

10:48.930 --> 10:52.170
do you know a man named Dariel?

10:55.500 --> 10:56.420
It isn't me!

10:56.860 --> 10:58.340
You have the wrong person!

11:02.160 --> 11:04.490
It is that person's fault...

11:04.490 --> 11:09.170
that my body has been burned 
by my old friend Salamandra.

11:09.170 --> 11:10.370
Salamandra?

11:10.370 --> 11:15.190
If it isn't you, then which man is Dariel?

11:17.920 --> 11:19.950
I-I am Dariel.

11:21.200 --> 11:26.200
I cannot tell if you are 
a coward or very brave.

11:27.520 --> 11:30.960
When you say Salamandra, 
do you mean that dragon?

11:31.620 --> 11:34.070
If I've caused you any problems, I apologize.

11:34.070 --> 11:36.960
But saying it's my fault is a little...

11:36.960 --> 11:41.970
Salamandra reflects the rage of the caster.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.550
Caster?

11:43.550 --> 11:44.470
Rage?

11:44.670 --> 11:47.470
Bring forth your piece of my body.

11:47.470 --> 11:48.040
What?

11:48.040 --> 11:52.090
That which you all call mythril.

11:52.090 --> 11:53.390
Oh, of course.

11:59.150 --> 12:02.010
My body has become so very beautiful!

12:02.010 --> 12:06.770
It must have found a good smith
, and a good wielder!

12:08.080 --> 12:08.830
Well, then.

12:09.260 --> 12:10.860
I shall reward you.

12:13.730 --> 12:15.080
Hot!

12:15.080 --> 12:20.990
Some of the restrictions present in the 
structure of the mythril have been released.

12:20.990 --> 12:23.160
It is someone such as yourself...

12:23.160 --> 12:26.580
who embodies what that person 
so longs for and dreams of.

12:27.180 --> 12:29.140
Wh-Who are you?

12:29.480 --> 12:35.350
I am the Magical Earth Beast, 
Gigantomachia, little Dariel.

12:36.000 --> 12:40.150
Next, Lux Village will become a battlefield.

12:40.150 --> 12:41.360
What do you mean?

12:42.150 --> 12:43.360
Mister Gigantomachia?

12:48.010 --> 12:50.270
Lux Village will become a battlefield?

12:50.720 --> 12:53.120
Hey!

12:53.720 --> 12:55.020
We found him!

12:55.020 --> 12:56.370
Are you all right?

12:57.180 --> 12:58.510
You saved me!

12:58.510 --> 13:01.190
Now that Master Dariel is here, 
there's no need to worry!

12:58.980 --> 13:00.290
I'm so glad.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.520
Lord Granbarza?

13:04.520 --> 13:07.720
<i>About the magical beast 
at the mine, Salamandra...</i>

13:07.720 --> 13:08.420
Yes?

13:09.840 --> 13:12.370
The one controlling it is Bashbarza.

13:13.430 --> 13:15.570
<i>That sense of nostalgia I felt then...</i>

13:17.220 --> 13:19.020
<i>So that's what it was.</i>

13:19.660 --> 13:22.230
<i>He's used hexes.</i>

13:22.230 --> 13:23.430
Hexes?

13:23.430 --> 13:26.770
<i>He is using the legendary four 
magical beasts which bring calamity,</i>

13:26.770 --> 13:28.530
<i>and plans to kill the Heroes and their party.</i>

13:29.430 --> 13:31.680
It's likely that his target is me.

13:31.680 --> 13:34.040
And he might also be after Lux Village.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.290
Dariel...

13:38.090 --> 13:40.540
They called him Mayor, didn't they?

13:41.100 --> 13:44.520
Considering what's close to 
the mine, it must be Lux Village.

13:47.370 --> 13:49.550
Those things which are precious to you...

13:50.140 --> 13:52.310
I'll burn them all!

13:54.060 --> 13:57.060
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

13:59.420 --> 14:00.790
Is everything all right?

14:01.950 --> 14:03.870
What should we do?

14:05.480 --> 14:07.070
Everyone's worrying too much.

14:07.070 --> 14:08.280
Everything's fine.

14:08.590 --> 14:11.510
Father, please look after 
everyone in the village.

14:11.510 --> 14:13.790
Leave the evacuation to me.

14:14.330 --> 14:15.810
Well, I'll see you afterwards.

14:19.480 --> 14:20.490
Malika!

14:21.250 --> 14:22.540
Thank you for this.

14:23.120 --> 14:24.800
And as the finishing touch...

14:26.640 --> 14:27.550
It will protect you.

14:27.960 --> 14:29.860
But if I lose it...

14:29.860 --> 14:31.550
No, it's all right.

14:31.930 --> 14:35.060
I will always be with you.

14:35.970 --> 14:37.310
Now, go and come back safely!

14:40.500 --> 14:41.580
I'll be back.

15:18.080 --> 15:19.600
Hey there, Dariel!

15:20.970 --> 15:22.650
Lord Bashbarza.

15:22.650 --> 15:23.610
It's so dark.

15:32.380 --> 15:34.620
Now I can see your face very clearly.

15:35.490 --> 15:39.120
That's Granbarza's wide-range 
annihilation magic.

15:39.600 --> 15:42.830
Depending on how it's used, 
that technique can steal away the user's life.

15:43.480 --> 15:47.620
Does this mean that the current General 
of Fire rivals the previous one?

15:52.060 --> 15:53.390
Lord Bashbarza!

15:53.920 --> 15:55.640
Calm down and let's talk!

15:56.010 --> 15:57.010
Dariel?

15:57.710 --> 15:59.390
Are you married?

16:00.200 --> 16:00.860
What?

16:01.720 --> 16:03.140
Congratulations!

16:03.770 --> 16:06.150
And what perfect timing!

16:07.360 --> 16:08.400
Timing?

16:09.600 --> 16:13.660
Have you ever taken a tumble 
since becoming an adult?

16:17.640 --> 16:20.270
When I was a child, any time my 
face crumpled, on the verge of tears,

16:20.270 --> 16:23.740
some adult I didn't know would be kind 
enough to tell me, "It's all right."

16:23.740 --> 16:26.040
Then they'd use mugwort 
leaves to stem the bleeding.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.390
But...

16:29.950 --> 16:32.430
I took a tumble after becoming an adult.

16:33.460 --> 16:34.940
That's how I realized it.

16:35.600 --> 16:40.340
"Oh, falling hurts more after 
becoming an adult," I thought.

16:41.000 --> 16:43.300
You can't let your face crumple, 
on the verge of tears.

16:43.300 --> 16:45.550
And no one will say a kind word to you.

16:47.150 --> 16:50.890
The more burdens you're 
carrying when you fall...

16:51.620 --> 16:52.900
the more severe the pain is.

16:55.320 --> 16:56.410
Dariel...

16:57.660 --> 16:59.910
First, I will kill your woman.

17:00.720 --> 17:03.160
Then I will burn your village to the ground.

17:06.390 --> 17:09.290
Please help my son when he needs it.

17:10.400 --> 17:11.820
<i>I wanted to do that.</i>

17:13.000 --> 17:14.560
<i>I've wanted to do that for all this time.</i>

17:16.710 --> 17:18.070
<i>But I'm sorry.</i>

17:19.790 --> 17:21.340
I will stop you.

17:23.440 --> 17:25.200
I will do whatever it takes!

17:26.490 --> 17:29.810
Now, let's wipe it all away, Salamandra!

17:29.810 --> 17:32.570
Everything Dariel is connected to!

17:32.900 --> 17:34.320
He's heading for the village!

17:39.440 --> 17:40.280
A whip?

17:41.260 --> 17:42.930
I see it's made of mythril.

17:42.930 --> 17:48.540
But a mere mythril weapon will 
not be enough to stop Salamandra.

17:56.840 --> 17:59.260
Zebiantes? You're quick.

17:59.260 --> 18:03.640
You shouldn't underestimate the strongest 
and fastest of the four attributes.

18:05.640 --> 18:06.800
Sky Rend!

18:08.940 --> 18:09.900
Everyone!

18:09.900 --> 18:11.690
Please take care of the magical beast!

18:13.380 --> 18:14.150
Hey.

18:14.740 --> 18:18.150
Even if you pull me away from the 
magical beast, the hex won't break.

18:18.570 --> 18:22.020
Even so, I cannot allow you to remain there!

18:28.030 --> 18:32.640
If you're troubled over the 
Mythril Mine, then I apologize!

18:32.640 --> 18:36.670
If you wish it, then let's 
establish official negotiations.

18:37.030 --> 18:39.800
Things turned out this way by 
chance, but it is partly my fault.

18:40.540 --> 18:43.430
So it really was you who did that.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.440
What?

18:45.440 --> 18:47.430
<i>H-He didn't know?</i>

18:47.430 --> 18:50.190
Th-Then why do you resent me so much?

18:50.980 --> 18:53.820
Resent? No, that's not it.

18:53.820 --> 18:55.440
It's for the sake of my dream.

18:56.000 --> 18:56.890
Your dream?

18:56.890 --> 18:59.700
I want to bring the 
Human-Demon War to an end.

19:00.380 --> 19:04.310
The reason I had Salamandra 
attack the Mythril Mine

19:04.310 --> 19:06.200
was to lure you out, Dariel.

19:06.870 --> 19:09.960
You are a traitor, but you
 once worked under me.

19:10.320 --> 19:13.240
I must first clear away my failures.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.960
Everything else will begin after that.

19:15.790 --> 19:17.360
I will kill the Heroes...

19:17.360 --> 19:19.300
bring humanity to ruins...

19:19.300 --> 19:21.890
and bring this conflict to an end.

19:21.890 --> 19:23.550
And then I...

19:24.680 --> 19:28.930
I will surpass that man who would join 
forces with the Heroes, my father in name only,

19:29.970 --> 19:33.940
and become the General of the Transcendent 
Tempest, strongest of all!

19:35.230 --> 19:36.320
I won't let you.

19:36.820 --> 19:38.570
I will stop you, no matter what!

19:38.860 --> 19:41.820
You? The incompetent?

19:58.360 --> 19:59.550
Die.

20:14.560 --> 20:16.110
<i>Lord Bashbarza...</i>

20:16.790 --> 20:19.320
<i>has always been a gifted mage.</i>

20:20.640 --> 20:22.820
<i>He's grown stronger again.</i>

20:25.160 --> 20:26.320
For the last year...

20:27.240 --> 20:29.740
I searched through the hexes 
in the Room of Secrets,

20:30.340 --> 20:32.900
and I finally discovered this.

20:33.840 --> 20:36.690
When, after much research, 
I acquired the skill,

20:36.690 --> 20:38.670
I traveled the world,

20:39.610 --> 20:42.490
and managed to force 
Salamandra to submit to me.

20:44.670 --> 20:45.980
I see.

20:48.420 --> 20:50.010
You've worked very hard.

20:51.620 --> 20:53.520
You are so overflowing with talent,

20:54.300 --> 20:56.960
so diligent... I don't know anyone 
who surpasses you in those things.

20:56.960 --> 20:57.830
But...

20:59.360 --> 21:00.460
I don't know...

21:00.890 --> 21:02.360
You're just too earnest.

21:02.980 --> 21:05.000
Sometimes, you can't seem 
to see what's around you.

21:06.080 --> 21:07.370
If I'd had my wish...

21:08.150 --> 21:10.810
I'd wanted to become your eyes.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.060
Stop being so full of yourself.

21:17.120 --> 21:19.860
You piece of trash!

21:25.800 --> 21:27.140
Fearsome Emperor's Sky Rend!

21:38.130 --> 21:39.580
Lord Bashbarza!

21:46.080 --> 21:47.180
Blast it...

21:48.840 --> 21:53.160
Against this... trash?

21:56.150 --> 21:58.270
This was meant for killing the Heroes.

21:59.990 --> 22:01.420
It's my trump card.

22:02.350 --> 22:05.050
I never imagined you'd make me use it.

22:06.770 --> 22:08.320
Lord Bashbarza...

23:42.030 --> 23:46.570
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s after 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.570 --> 23:48.820
"Dariel Reaches Out His Hand."

23:48.820 --> 23:51.070
<b>Episode 12</b>

23:48.820 --> 23:51.070
<b>Dariel Reaches Out His Hand.</b>
